      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "id": "titleblock-div-0",
          "text": "<div class=\"book-title-block\">\r\n        <h1>APPLETONS' CYCLOPÆDIA OF AMERICAN BIOGRAPHY</h1>\r\n        <h2>BY MARK TWAIN</h2>\r\n\r\n    </div>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "id": "prologue-div-1",
          "text": "<div class=\"book-text-content\">\r\n        <table align=\"center\" width=\"80%\">\r\n            <tbody>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td>As it is the commendation of a good huntsman to find game in a wide wood, so it is no imputation\r\n                        if he hath not caught all. Plato. </td>\r\n                </tr>\r\n            </tbody>\r\n        </table>\r\n        <table align=\"center\">\r\n            <tbody>\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td><span><b>Volumes</b></span>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li><a href=\"/wiki/Appletons%27_Cyclop%C3%A6dia_of_American_Biography/Volume_I._Aaron-Crandall\"\r\n                                    title=\"Appletons' Cyclopædia of American Biography/Volume I. Aaron-Crandall\">I.\r\n                                    Aaron–Crandall</a></li>\r\n                            <li><a href=\"/wiki/Appletons%27_Cyclop%C3%A6dia_of_American_Biography/Volume_II._Crane-Grimshaw\"\r\n                                    title=\"Appletons' Cyclopædia of American Biography/Volume II. Crane-Grimshaw\">II.\r\n                                    Crane–Grimshaw</a></li>\r\n                            <li><a href=\"/wiki/Appletons%27_Cyclop%C3%A6dia_of_American_Biography/Volume_III._Grinnell-Lockwood\"\r\n                                    title=\"Appletons' Cyclopædia of American Biography/Volume III. Grinnell-Lockwood\">III.\r\n                                    Grinnell–Lockwood</a></li>\r\n                            <li><a href=\"/wiki/Appletons%27_Cyclop%C3%A6dia_of_American_Biography/Volume_IV._Lodge-Pickens\"\r\n                                    title=\"Appletons' Cyclopædia of American Biography/Volume IV. Lodge-Pickens\">IV.\r\n                                    Lodge–Pickens</a></li>\r\n                            <li><a href=\"/wiki/Appletons%27_Cyclop%C3%A6dia_of_American_Biography/Volume_V._Pickering-Sumter\"\r\n                                    title=\"Appletons' Cyclopædia of American Biography/Volume V. Pickering-Sumter\">V.\r\n                                    Pickering–Sumter</a></li>\r\n                            <li><a href=\"/wiki/Appletons%27_Cyclop%C3%A6dia_of_American_Biography/Volume_VI._Sunderland-Zurita\"\r\n                                    title=\"Appletons' Cyclopædia of American Biography/Volume VI. Sunderland-Zurita\">VI.\r\n                                    Sunderland–Zurita</a></li>\r\n                            <li><a href=\"/wiki/Appletons%27_Cyclop%C3%A6dia_of_American_Biography/Supplement\"\r\n                                    title=\"Appletons' Cyclopædia of American Biography/Supplement\">Supplement</a></li>\r\n                        </ul>\r\n                        <p> <span><b>Lists</b></span> </p>\r\n                        <ul>\r\n                            <li><a href=\"/wiki/Appletons%27_Cyclop%C3%A6dia_of_American_Biography/Fictitious_Entries\"\r\n                                    title=\"Appletons' Cyclopædia of American Biography/Fictitious Entries\">Fictitious\r\n                                    Entries</a></li>\r\n                            <li><a href=\"/wiki/Appletons%27_Cyclop%C3%A6dia_of_American_Biography/Suspicious_Entries\"\r\n                                    title=\"Appletons' Cyclopædia of American Biography/Suspicious Entries\">Suspicious\r\n                                    Entries</a></li>\r\n                        </ul>\r\n                    </td>\r\n                </tr>\r\n            </tbody>\r\n        </table>\r\n    </div>"
